### HF-36 — Health check (liveness)
GET http://localhost:8081/health
Accept: application/json

# Esperado: 200 { "status": "ok" }

### Métricas Prometheus (servidor separado, porta APP_METRICS_PORT)
GET http://localhost:9090/metrics

# Esperado: 200 com as métricas (http_request_duration_seconds, http_requests_total, ...)
